%% UC-12 — Log daily behaviour (idempotent upsert)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (dailyLogService)
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Mark habit done / not done for today
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/habits/intentions/:id/logs {date, enacted}
    B->>B: Verify intention belongs to user
    B->>M: upsert(daily_behavior_logs, key {intentionId, date}, {enacted, loggedAt})
    Note right of M: Unique index {intentionId, date} - re-logging same day overwrites
    M-->>B: upserted
    B-->>F: 200 log saved
    F->>B: GET /api/v1/habits/intentions/:id/logs
    B-->>F: log history (streak / adherence view)
